#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/FirstRunScreen.qml:214
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Everything you save is encrypted with this key. Only someone who holds its "
"private part and knows its passphrase can open the vault."
msgstr ""
"Todo lo que guardes se cifra con esta clave. Solo quien tiene su parte "
"privada y conoce su frase puede abrir la bóveda."

