#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:17
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window"
msgid "OpenPGP Online Services"
msgstr "Servicios online de OpenPGP"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:47
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check"
msgid "Enable online lookups"
msgstr "Activar consultas online"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:51
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Lookups happen only when you request them. The service receives the key's "
"fingerprint or ID."
msgstr ""
"Las consultas se realizan cuando las solicitas. El servicio recibe la huella "
"o el ID de la clave."

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:55
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Lookup services in the browser"
msgstr "Servicios de consulta en el navegador"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:63
#, kde-format
msgid "Online service URLs, one per line"
msgstr "URLs de servicios online, una por línea"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:67
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"One HTTP or HTTPS URL per line. Add, edit, remove or reorder the lines; the "
"first one is the default. KGpg placeholders: $$FPR$$, $$ID16$$ and $$ID8$$; "
"in lowercase: $$fpr$$, $$id16$$ and $$id8$$."
msgstr ""
"Una URL HTTP o HTTPS por línea. Añade, edita, elimina o mueve las líneas; la "
"primera es la predeterminada. Marcadores de KGpg: $$FPR$$, $$ID16$$ y $$ID8$"
"$; en minúsculas: $$fpr$$, $$id16$$ y $$id8$$."

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:71
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Servers for fetching and refreshing keys"
msgstr "Servidores para obtener y actualizar claves"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Key servers, one per line"
msgstr "Servidores de claves, uno por línea"

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:83
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"One HKP, HKPS, HTTP or HTTPS address per line. The first server is the "
"default. If the list is empty, GnuPG's configuration is used."
msgstr ""
"Una dirección HKP, HKPS, HTTP o HTTPS por línea. El primer servidor es el "
"predeterminado. Si la lista está vacía, se usa la configuración de GnuPG."

#: crates/kp-desktop/ui/qml/OnlineServicesDialog.qml:94
#, kde-format
